        <name>getBody</name>
        <qualifiedname>sf::Http::Response::getBody</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Get the body of the response. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The body of a response may contain: <itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>the requested page (for GET requests) </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para>a response from the server (for POST requests) </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para>nothing (for HEAD requests) </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para>an error message (in case of an error)</para>
</listitem>
